-->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"54%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:54%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.73rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E03673;font-size:0.73rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase\">Sobre o Meu Divã</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.8rem,2.8vw,2.2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,2.8vw,2.2rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2\">Um espaço que respeita seu tempo, sua história e seu jeito de ser.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#666\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.78\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#666;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.78\">O Meu Divã nasceu para tornar a terapia acessível, acolhedora e sem burocracia. Conectamos pacientes a terapeutas qualificados em uma plataforma segura, com foco no que realmente importa: o cuidado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"13px\",\"margin\":{\"top\":\"28px\",\"bottom\":\"32px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-top:28px;margin-bottom:32px\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"13px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"nowrap\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-resized\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img src=\"data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg xmlns=\'http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\' wi