n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"2.1rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:2.1rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:20px\">Um espaço que respeita<br>seu tempo, sua história<br>e seu jeito de ser.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#666\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#666;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;margin-bottom:32px\">O Meu Divã nasceu para tornar a terapia acessível, acolhedora e sem burocracia. Conectamos pacientes a terapeutas qualificados em uma plataforma segura, com foco no que realmente importa: o cuidado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- Diferenciais com ícone colorido -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"14px\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\">\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:12px\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">✅</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>Terapeutas verificados</strong> — formação e registro validados</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#fce7ef;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">🔒</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>Sigilo total</strong> — suas sessões são protegidas e confidenciais</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">📋</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>Prontuário digital</strong> — histórico organizado a cada sessão</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#fce7ef;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">🗓</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>Flexibilidade total</strong> — agende, cancele ou reagende sem burocracia</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">💻</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>100% online</strong> — de qualquer lugar, no seu ritmo</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"32px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E03673\",\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"14px\",\"bottom\":\"14px\",\"left\":\"28px\",\"right\":\"28px\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"600\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/busca\" style=\"background-color:#E03673;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:50px;padding:14px 28px;font-weight:600\">Conhecer os terapeutas →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<p><!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n     BLOCO 5 — PARA QUEM É\n     3 cards com foto real integrada à paleta\n     Fotos: contexto de vida real, tons quentes/naturais\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --></p>\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"80px\",\"bottom\":\"80px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#F4F7FF\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1100px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"background-color:#F4F7FF;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:80px;padding-bottom:80px\">\n<!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"text-align:center;margin-bottom:52px\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.75rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#E03673;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px\">Um espaço para todos</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"level\":2,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"2.1rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:2.1rem;font-weight:800\">Um espaço para diferentes caminhos</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\">\n<!-- CARD: Para você - foto mulher em paz, tons azulados -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 32px rgba(47,128,211,0.1)\">\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin:0\">\n  <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544005313-94ddf0286df2?w=500&q=85&fit=crop&crop=top\" alt=\"Mulher serena, cuidando da saúde emocional\" style=\"width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top\"/>\n</figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<div style=\"padding:28px 28px 32px\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.72rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"2px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#E03673;font-weight:700;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px\">Para você</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.2rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px\">Cuidado emocional no seu ritmo</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#666\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.92rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.65\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#666;font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:20px\">Liberdade e autonomia para escolher seu terapeuta, seu horário e construir seu processo de cuidado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E03673\",\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"10px\",\"bottom\":\"10px\",\"left\":\"22px\",\"right\":\"22px\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.85rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/para-voce\" style=\"background-color:#E03673;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:50px;padding:10px 22px;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600\">Saiba mais →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- CARD: Para terapeutas - foto profissional confiante -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 32px rgba(47,128,211,0.1)\">\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin:0\">\n  <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1573496359142-b8d87734a5a2?w=500&q=85&fit=crop&crop=top\" alt=\"Terapeuta profissional, confiante e acolhedora\" style=\"width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center top\"/>\n</figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<div style=\"padding:28px 28px 32px\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#2F80D3\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.72rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"2px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#2F80D3;font-weight:700;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px\">Para terapeutas</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.2rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px\">Construa sua prática com autonomia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#666\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.92rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.65\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#666;font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:20px\">Agenda, prontuário, gestão financeira e captação de pacientes — tudo integrado para você focar no que importa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#2F80D3\",\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"10px\",\"bottom\":\"10px\",\"left\":\"22px\",\"right\":\"22px\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.85rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/para-terapeutas\" style=\"background-color:#2F80D3;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:50px;padding:10px 22px;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600\">Saiba mais →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n<!-- CARD: Para empresas - foto equipe diversa, ambiente positivo -->\n<!-- wp:column -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 6px 32px rgba(47,128,211,0.1)\">\n<!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\"} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full\" style=\"margin:0\">\n  <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1522202176988-66273c2fd55f?w=500&q=85&fit=crop&crop=center\" alt=\"Equipe diversa e engajada, ambiente de trabalho saudável\" style=\"width:100%;height:220px;object-fit:cover;object-position:center\"/>\n</figure>\n<!-- /wp:image -->\n<div style=\"padding:28px 28px 32px\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.72rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"2px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#E03673;font-weight:700;font-size:0.72rem;letter-spacing:2px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:10px\">Para empresas</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.2rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"700\"}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:1.2rem;font-weight:700;margin-bottom:10px\">Saúde emocional como estratégia</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#666\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.92rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.65\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#666;font-size:0.92rem;line-height:1.65;margin-bottom:20px\">Reduza afastamentos, aumente engajamento e construa uma cultura de cuidado real com seus colaboradores.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E03673\",\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"10px\",\"bottom\":\"10px\",\"left\":\"22px\",\"right\":\"22px\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.85rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"600\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/empresas\" style=\"background-color:#E03673;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:50px;padding:10px 22px;font-size:0.85rem;font-weight:600\">Saiba mais →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons -->\n</div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<p><!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n     BLOCO 6 — DEPOIMENTOS\n     Fundo branco, quote grande + foto real lateral\n     Foto: pessoa radiante, expressão genuína\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ --></p>\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"88px\",\"bottom\":\"88px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1100px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:88px;padding-bottom:88px\">\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"72px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\">\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"54%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:54%\">\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.75rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#E03673;font-weight:700;font-size:0.75rem;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:16px\">Depoimentos</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"2.1rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:2.1rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin-bottom:40px\">Quem começa, continua.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n<!-- Depoimento 1 -->\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"background:#F9F5FF;border-radius:20px;padding:28px;border-left:4px solid #E03673;margin-bottom:16px\">\n  <p style=\"color:#333;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 20px\">\"Finalmente encontrei um terapeuta que entende minhas necessidades. A plataforma é simples, acolhedora e o atendimento excepcional. Mudou minha relação comigo mesma.\"</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1494790108377-be9c29b29330?w=80&q=85&fit=crop&crop=face\" alt=\"Ana M.\" style=\"width:44px;height:44px;border-radius:50%;object-fit:cover;flex-shrink:0\"/>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.9rem;color:#1a1a2e\">Ana M.</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.78rem;color:#999\">São Paulo, SP &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n<!-- Depoimento 2 -->\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:20px;padding:28px;border-left:4px solid #2F80D3\">\n  <p style=\"color:#333;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75;font-style:italic;margin:0 0 20px\">\"O processo foi simples desde o início. Encontrei minha terapeuta em minutos e a sessão aconteceu no mesmo dia. Recomendo para todo mundo que está pensando em começar.\"</p>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1507003211169-0a1dd7228f2d?w=80&q=85&fit=crop&crop=face\" alt=\"Carlos R.\" style=