sessões são protegidas e confidenciais</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">📋</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>Prontuário digital</strong> — histórico organizado a cada sessão</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#fce7ef;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">🗓</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>Flexibilidade total</strong> — agende, cancele ou reagende sem burocracia</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px\">\n    <div style=\"width:32px;height:32px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:8px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">💻</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.95rem;color:#333\"><strong>100% online</strong> — de qualquer lugar, no seu ritmo</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"32px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:32px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E03673\",\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"14px\",\"bottom\":\"14px\",\"left\":\"28px\",\"right\":\"28px\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"600\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-background wp-element-button\" href=\"/busca\" style=\"background-color:#E03673;color:#FFFFFF;border-radius:50px;padding:14px 28px;font-weight:600\">Conhecer os terapeutas →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:buttons