\"fontSize\":\"0.90rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#666;font-size:0.90rem;line-height:1.7\">Prontuário, orientações e histórico completo. Acompanhamento contínuo na sua jornada.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n\n<!-- ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════\n     SOBRE O MEU DIVÃ\n     Foto: terapeuta em sessão, olhar acolhedor, luz lateral quente\n     object-position: 50% 20% → enquadra rosto e busto\n════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════ -->\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"96px\",\"bottom\":\"96px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#FFFFFF\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1100px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\" style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:96px;padding-bottom:96px\">\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"80px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\">\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"46%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:46%;position:relative\">\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"border-radius:24px;overflow:hidden;position:relative\">\n  <!-- Terapeuta profissional sorridente, sessão de terapia, luz quente -->\n  <img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1582750433449-648ed127bb54?w=700&q=88&fit=crop\" alt=\"Terapeuta profissional em sessão, expressão acolhedora\" style=\"width:100%;height:520px;object-fit:cover;object-position:50% 15%;display:block;border-radius:24px\"/>\n  <!-- Badge flutuante -->\n  <div style=\"position:absolute;bottom:24px;left:24px;background:#FFFFFF;border-radius:16px;padding:14px 20px;box-shadow:0 8px 32px rgba(0,0,0,0.14);display:flex;align-items:center;gap:14px\">\n    <div style=\"width:44px;height:44px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#E03673,#f47aa7);border-radius:12px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-size:22px;flex-shrink:0\">💬</div>\n    <div>\n      <div style=\"font-weight:700;font-size:0.88rem;color:#1a1a2e;line-height:1.2\">+2.000 sessões</div>\n      <div style=\"font-size:0.75rem;color:#999;line-height:1.2\">realizadas com cuidado</div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"54%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:54%\">\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.73rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#E03673;font-weight:700;font-size:0.73rem;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase;margin:0 0 16px\">Sobre o Meu Divã</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":2,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.8rem,2.8vw,2.2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,2.8vw,2.2rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2;margin:0 0 20px\">Um espaço que respeita seu tempo, sua história e seu jeito de ser.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#666\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.78\"}}} -->\n<p style=\"color:#666;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.78;margin:0 0 32px\">O Meu Divã nasceu para tornar a terapia acessível, acolhedora e sem burocracia. Conectamos pacientes a terapeutas qualificados em uma plataforma segura, com foco no que realmente importa: o cuidado.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:html -->\n<div style=\"display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:13px;margin-bottom:36px\">\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px\">\n    <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">✅</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.94rem;color:#2a2a2a\"><strong>Terapeutas verificados</strong> — formação e registro validados</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px\">\n    <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;background:#fce7ef;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">🔒</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.94rem;color:#2a2a2a\"><strong>Sigilo total</strong> — suas sessões são protegidas e confidenciais</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px\">\n    <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">📋</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.94rem;color:#2a2a2a\"><strong>Prontuário digital</strong> — histórico organizado a cada sessão</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px\">\n    <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;background:#fce7ef;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">🗓</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.94rem;color:#2a2a2a\"><strong>Flexibilidade total</strong> — agende, cancele ou reagende sem burocracia</p>\n  </div>\n  <div style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:13px\">\n    <div style=\"width:34px;height:34px;background:#EBF4FF;border-radius:9px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;flex-shrink:0;font-size:15px\">💻</div>\n    <p style=\"margin:0;font-size:0.94rem;color:#2a2a2a\"><strong>100% online</strong> — de qualquer lugar, no seu ritmo</p>\n  </div>\n</div>\n<!-- /wp:html -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\">\n<!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E03673\",\"text\":\"#FFFFFF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"5