lock-group alignwide\"><!-- wp:site-logo /-->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:columns -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"100%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:100%\"><!-- wp:site-title {\"level\":2} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:site-tagline /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\"><!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"var:preset|spacing|40\",\"width\":\"0px\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:var(--wp--preset--spacing--40);width:0px\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|80\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"verticalAlignment\":\"top\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:navigation {\"ref\":32,\"overlayMenu\":\"never\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} /-->\n\n<!-- wp:navigation {\"ref\":34,\"overlayMenu\":\"never\",\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"orientation\":\"vertical\"}} /--></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:spacer {\"height\":\"var:preset|spacing|70\"} -->\n<div style=\"height:var(--wp--preset--spacing--70)\" aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-spacer\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:spacer -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":\"var:preset|spacing|20\"}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\",\"justifyContent\":\"space-between\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">© Copyright 2026.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"fontSize\":\"small\"} -->\n<p class=\"has-small-font-size\">\n				Designed with <a href=\"https://wordpress.org\" rel=\"nofollow\">WordPress</a>			</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->','Rodapé','','publish','closed','closed','','footer','','','2026-04-09 19:45:41','2026-04-09 19:45:41','',0,'https://meudivaonline.com/?p=36',0,'wp_template_part','',0),(41,1,'2024-11-09 17:09:36','2024-11-09 17:09:36','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Some flowers, like the unassuming yet striking bloodwort, captivate with their understated elegance. With clusters of tiny pink buds, bloodwort offers a subtle beauty that whispers rather than shouts. This wildflower reminds us of the beauty that can be found in nature’s quieter corners, celebrating simplicity and calm in its gentle bloom.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Every flower has a unique story to tell, from the grandest rose to the smallest wild bloom. Arrangements that include delicate flowers like bloodwort encourage a deeper appreciation for all forms of floral beauty, highlighting the charm of even the most modest blossoms. These natural touches invite a moment of reflection and calm into our lives, celebrating the intricate wonder of nature and reminding us of the peaceful, often-overlooked beauty that surrounds us every day.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','The delicate charm of bloodwort blooms','','publish','open','open','','the-delicate-charm-of-bloodwort-blooms','','','2024-11-09 17:09:36','2024-11-09 17:09:36','',0,'https://meudivaonline.com/?p=41',0,'post','',0),(42,1,'2024-11-10 17:10:36','2024-11-10 17:10:36','','bloodwort','','inherit','open','closed','','bloodwort','','','2024-11-10 17:10:36','2024-11-10 17:10:36','',41,'https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/bloodwort.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(43,1,'2024-11-10 17:15:15','2024-11-10 17:15:15','<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>Sunflowers have a way of capturing the heart with their vibrant yellow petals and striking dark centers, reminiscent of the sun itself. But these beauties are more than mere decorations; they are thriving ecosystems, supporting countless insects and playing a vital role in nature. The image above captures this perfectly, as a small beetle delicately balances on a sunflower petal, revealing a hidden world of interconnected life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p>At Fleurs, we believe flowers are not just ornaments—they are invitations to explore the wonders of the natural world. Sunflowers, for example, symbolize loyalty and adoration, but they also provide nourishment and shelter to small creatures. Every bloom we deliver is a reminder of this intricate relationship. Through our flower arrangements, we hope to bring a piece of nature into your home, encouraging appreciation for the small yet significant moments in life.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','The story of sunflowers and their little visitors','','publish','open','open','','the-story-of-sunflowers-and-their-little-visitors','','','2024-11-10 17:15:15','2024-11-10 17:15:15','',0,'https://meudivaonline.com/?p=43',0,'post','',0),(44,1,'2024-11-10 17:15:05','2024-11-10 17:15:05','','sunflower','','inherit','open','closed','','sunflower','','','2024-11-10 17:15:05','2024-11-10 17:15:05','',43,'https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2024/11/sunflower.webp',0,'attachment','image/webp',0),(45,1,'2026-04-09 19:45:41','2026-04-09 19:45:41','<!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Instagram\",\"url\":\"#\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /--><!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"YouTube\",\"url\":\"#\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /--><!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"LinkedIn\",\"url\":\"#\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /--><!-- wp:navigation-link {\"label\":\"Facebook\",\"url\":\"#\",\"kind\":\"custom\"} /-->','Footer navigation','','inherit','closed','closed','','34-revision-v1','','','2026-04-09 19:45:41','2026-04-09 19:45:41','',34,'https://meudivaonline.com/?p=45',0,'revision','',0),(46,1,'202