apeutas verificados</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div></div>\n<!-- /wp:cover -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph -->\n<p></p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->','Para Você','','inherit','closed','closed','','96-revision-v1','','','2026-04-11 13:56:49','2026-04-11 16:56:49','',96,'https://meudivaonline.com/?p=168',0,'revision','',0),(172,1,'2026-04-12 00:07:11','2026-04-12 03:07:11','<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Banner-novo-Instituto-Alonso-39-1024x324.png\",\"id\":103,\"dimRatio\":72,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#ae9487\",\"isUserOverlayColor\":false,\"minHeight\":600,\"minHeightUnit\":\"px\",\"contentPosition\":\"center left\",\"isDark\":false,\"sizeSlug\":\"large\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull is-light has-custom-content-position is-position-center-left\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;min-height:600px\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background wp-image-103 size-large\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Banner-novo-Instituto-Alonso-39-1024x324.png\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-70 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#ae9487\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1100px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:0;padding-bottom:0\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"60%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"88px\",\"bottom\":\"88px\",\"right\":\"56px\",\"left\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"padding-top:88px;padding-right:56px;padding-bottom:88px;padding-left:0;flex-basis:60%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#f9aecb\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.75rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#f9aecb;font-size:0.75rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase\">✦ &nbsp;Cuidado para você</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":1,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#ffffff\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2.4rem,4.2vw,3.4rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.1\"}}} -->\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:clamp(2.4rem,4.2vw,3.4rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.1\">Cuidar da sua saúde emocional pode ser mais simples <mark style=\"background-color:transparent;color:#E03673\" class=\"has-inline-color\">do que parece.</mark></h1>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.82)\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.8\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.82);font-size:1.1rem;line-height:1.8\">Encontre um terapeuta, agende sua sessão e inicie seu processo com segurança, acolhimento e sem burocracia. Do conforto da sua casa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E03673\",\"text\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"16px\",\"bottom\":\"16px\",\"left\":\"36px\",\"right\":\"36px\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"1rem\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"/busca\" style=\"border-radius:50px;color:#ffffff;background-color:#E03673;padding-top:16px;padding-right:36px;pa