 is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1586281380349-632531db7ed4?w=700&amp;q=88&amp;fit=crop\" alt=\"Pessoa preenchendo formulário de cadastro online no computador\" style=\"border-radius:20px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.5rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2\">Crie seu perfil profissional</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75\">Preencha seus dados, formação, abordagem terapêutica e valor de sessão. Seu perfil passa por análise e, após aprovação, você já pode receber seus pacientes particulares por convite. Rápido e sem burocracia.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"64px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\" style=\"margin-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"order\":\"2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":99,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/1.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-99\" style=\"border-radius:20px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.5rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2\">Configure sua disponibilidade</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75\">Defina seus dias e horários de atendimento. A plataforma exibe sua disponibilidade em tempo real para os pacientes. Você controla tudo — incluindo bloqueios, pausas e períodos de férias.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"64px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\" style=\"margin-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":126,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/35.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-126\" style=\"border-radius:20px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.5rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2\">Realize sessões com segurança</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75\">O link do Google Meet é gerado automaticamente. Após a sessão, registre o prontuário na plataforma e envie orientações personalizadas para o paciente. Tudo em um só lugar, seguro e confidencial.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"order\":\"2\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1554224155-6726b3ff858f?w=700&amp;q=88&amp;fit=crop\" alt=\"Relatório financeiro e gestão de receitas no computador\" style=\"border-radius:20px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"level\":3,\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.5rem\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:1.5rem;font-weight:800;line-height:1.2\">Receba no 5º dia útil do mês</h3>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75\">Pagamento garantido todo mês via PIX ou transferência bancária, separado por tipo de paciente (particular e corporativo). Acompanhe seus relatórios financeiros em tempo real na plataforma.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"96px\",\"bottom\":\"96px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}},\"backgroundColor\":\"white\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-white-background-color has-background\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:96px;padding-bottom:96px\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"1100px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"72px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"55%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:55%\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.73rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E03673;font-size:0.73rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase\">Quem já faz parte</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.8rem,2.8vw,2.2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.2\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"40px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:40px;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,2.8vw,2.2rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.2\">Terapeutas que transformaram sua prática.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#F9F5FF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"24px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"36px\",\"bottom\":\"36px\",\"left\":\"36px\",\"right\":\"36px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:24px;background-color:#F9F5FF;margin-bottom:16px;padding-top:36px;padding-right:36px;padding-bottom:36px;padding-left:36px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"2.5rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E03673;margin-bottom:16px;font-size:2.5rem;line-height:1\">\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#222\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.85\",\"fontStyle\":\"italic\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"28px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#222;margin-bottom:28px;font-size:1.05rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.85\">Entrar no Meu Divã foi um divisor de águas na minha carreira. Consegui estruturar minha agenda, parei de perder tempo com remarcações e hoje tenho mais pacientes do que nunca — sem abrir mão da qualidade dos atendimentos. A plataforma cuida da parte burocrática para que eu me concentre no que realmente importa.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"16px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns\"><!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"60px\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:60px\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":127,\"sizeSlug\":\"thumbnail\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"className\":\"is-resized\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50%\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-thumbnail has-custom-border is-resized\"><img src=\"https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Amanda-150x150.jpg\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-127\" style=\"border-radius:50%\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.97rem\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"2px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:2px;font-size:0.97rem;font-weight:700\">Dra. Camila Freitas</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#999\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.82rem\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#999;margin-top:0;font-size:0.82rem\">Psicóloga · CRP 06/12345 · São Paulo, SP &nbsp;·&nbsp; 2 anos na plataforma</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#EBF4FF\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"16px\",\"left\":{\"color\":\"#2F80D3\",\"width\":\"4px\"}},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"22px\",\"bottom\":\"22px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group has-background\" style=\"border-radius:16px;border-left-color:#2F80D3;border-left-width:4px;background-color:#EBF4FF;padding-top:22px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:22px;padding-left:24px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#333\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.92rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\",\"fontStyle\":\"italic\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"14px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#333;margin-bottom:14px;font-size:0.92rem;font-style:italic;line-height:1.7\">\"A agenda integrada e o prontuário digital mudaram completamente minha rotina. Agora consigo focar 100% no paciente durante as sessões.\"</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#999\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.80rem\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#999;font-size:0.80rem\"><strong style=\"color:#1a1a2e\">Dr. Rafael Andrade</strong> &nbsp;·&nbsp; Psicanalista · Rio de Janeiro, RJ &nbsp;·&nbsp; ⭐⭐⭐⭐⭐</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"width\":\"45%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column\" style=\"flex-basis:45%\"><!-- wp:image {\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"24px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1559839734-2b71ea197ec2?w=600&amp;q=88&amp;fit=crop\" alt=\"Terapeuta profissional sorrindo, expressão de realização e confiança\" style=\"border-radius:24px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:group {\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#F4F8FF\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"88px\",\"bottom\":\"88px\"},\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group alignfull has-background\" style=\"background-color:#F4F8FF;margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0;padding-top:88px;padding-bottom:88px\"><!-- wp:group {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"800px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#E03673\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.73rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#E03673;font-size:0.73rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase\">Dúvidas frequentes</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#1a1a2e\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.2rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"48px\"}}}} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:#1a1a2e;margin-bottom:48px;font-size:clamp(1.8rem,3vw,2.2rem);font-weight:800\">Tudo o que você precisa saber</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#eef2f9\",\"width\":\"1px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ffffff\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"12px\"}}}} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color has-background\" style=\"border-color:#eef2f9;border-width:1px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\"><summary>Como faço meu cadastro na plataforma?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.94rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"14px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.7\">Clique em \"Quero fazer parte\", preencha seus dados, formação e abordagem terapêutica. Seu perfil passa por análise da nossa equipe. Após aprovação, você já pode receber seus pacientes particulares por convite. O processo é rápido — em geral aprovamos em até 48h úteis.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#eef2f9\",\"width\":\"1px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ffffff\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"12px\"}}}} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color has-background\" style=\"border-color:#eef2f9;border-width:1px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\"><summary>Como funciona o pagamento para o terapeuta?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.94rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"14px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.7\">O pagamento é feito sempre no 5º dia útil do mês via PIX ou transferência bancária. Você recebe em dois repasses separados: um com o total das sessões de pacientes particulares e outro com as sessões de pacientes corporativos (quando disponível no seu plano).</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#eef2f9\",\"width\":\"1px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ffffff\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"12px\"}}}} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color has-background\" style=\"border-color:#eef2f9;border-width:1px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\"><summary>Qual é a diferença entre os planos?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.94rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"14px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.7\">O plano Essencial é gratuito e permite atender seus próprios pacientes com comissão de 20%. O Profissional (R$79/mês) inclui visibilidade no marketplace, captação de novos pacientes e comissão de 10%. O Premium (R$149/mês) oferece destaque na busca, acesso a pacientes corporativos e a menor comissão do mercado: apenas 3%.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#eef2f9\",\"width\":\"1px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ffffff\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"12px\"}}}} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color has-background\" style=\"border-color:#eef2f9;border-width:1px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\"><summary>A plataforma é segura para realizar minhas sessões?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.94rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"14px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.7\">Sim. As sessões acontecem via Google Meet com criptografia de ponta a ponta. O conteúdo das sessões é completamente sigiloso — nem o Meu Divã tem acesso ao que é falado. Os prontuários ficam armazenados com segurança e só você tem acesso.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#eef2f9\",\"width\":\"1px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ffffff\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"12px\"}}}} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color has-background\" style=\"border-color:#eef2f9;border-width:1px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#ffffff;margin-bottom:12px;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\"><summary>Posso atender meus pacientes atuais pela plataforma?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.94rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"14px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.7\">Sim. Desde o plano Essencial você pode convidar seus pacientes atuais para a plataforma e continuar atendendo normalmente. A plataforma funciona como seu consultório digital — com agenda, prontuário e videochamada integrados.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details -->\n\n<!-- wp:details {\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"16px\",\"color\":\"#eef2f9\",\"width\":\"1px\"},\"color\":{\"background\":\"#ffffff\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"20px\",\"bottom\":\"20px\",\"left\":\"24px\",\"right\":\"24px\"}}}} -->\n<details class=\"wp-block-details has-border-color has-background\" style=\"border-color:#eef2f9;border-width:1px;border-radius:16px;background-color:#ffffff;padding-top:20px;padding-right:24px;padding-bottom:20px;padding-left:24px\"><summary>Quais profissionais podem se cadastrar?</summary><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"0.94rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.7\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"14px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;margin-top:14px;font-size:0.94rem;line-height:1.7\">Psicólogos, psicanalistas, terapeutas com formação reconhecida (como Gestalt, Humanista, Integrativa) e coaches certificados. Todos passam por verificação de credenciais antes da aprovação do perfil.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></details>\n<!-- /wp:details --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group --></div>\n<!-- /wp:group -->\n\n<!-- wp:cover {\"url\":\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557804506-669a67965ba0?w=1600\\u0026q=88\\u0026fit=crop\",\"dimRatio\":85,\"customOverlayColor\":\"#0c3464\",\"align\":\"full\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"top\":\"0\",\"bottom\":\"0\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-cover alignfull\" style=\"margin-top:0;margin-bottom:0\"><img class=\"wp-block-cover__image-background\" alt=\"\" src=\"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1557804506-669a67965ba0?w=1600&amp;q=88&amp;fit=crop\" data-object-fit=\"cover\"/><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"wp-block-cover__background has-background-dim-90 has-background-dim\" style=\"background-color:#0c3464\"></span><div class=\"wp-block-cover__inner-container\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"96px\",\"bottom\":\"96px\"}}},\"layout\":{\"type\":\"constrained\",\"contentSize\":\"720px\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"padding-top:96px;padding-bottom:96px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.65)\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"700\",\"fontSize\":\"0.73rem\",\"letterSpacing\":\"3px\",\"textTransform\":\"uppercase\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.65);font-size:0.73rem;font-weight:700;letter-spacing:3px;text-transform:uppercase\">A evolução começa agora</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:heading {\"textAlign\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem)\",\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.15\"}},\"textColor\":\"white\"} -->\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading has-text-align-center has-white-color has-text-color\" style=\"font-size:clamp(2rem,4vw,3rem);font-weight:800;line-height:1.15\">Sua prática clínica merece uma plataforma à altura.</h2>\n<!-- /wp:heading -->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"align\":\"center\",\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"rgba(255,255,255,0.80)\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1.08rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"},\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"44px\"}}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-align-center has-text-color\" style=\"color:rgba(255,255,255,0.80);margin-bottom:44px;font-size:1.08rem;line-height:1.75\">Cadastre-se hoje, comece no plano gratuito e evolua no seu ritmo. Sem burocracia, sem contratos.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph -->\n\n<!-- wp:buttons {\"layout\":{\"type\":\"flex\",\"justifyContent\":\"center\",\"flexWrap\":\"wrap\"}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-buttons\"><!-- wp:button {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"background\":\"#E03673\",\"text\":\"#ffffff\"},\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\"},\"spacing\":{\"padding\":{\"top\":\"18px\",\"bottom\":\"18px\",\"left\":\"44px\",\"right\":\"44px\"}},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"fontSize\":\"1.05rem\"}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-button\"><a class=\"wp-block-button__link has-text-color has-background has-custom-font-size wp-element-button\" href=\"https://app.meudivaonline.com/auth/signup\" style=\"border-radius:50px;color:#ffffff;background-color:#E03673;padding-top:18px;padding-right:44px;padding-bottom:18px;padding-left:44px;font-size:1.05rem;font-weight:800\">Quero fazer parte →</a></div>\n<!-- /wp:button -->\n\n<!-- wp:button {\"className\":\"is-style-outline\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"50px\",\"width\":\"2px\",\"color\":\"rgba(255,255,25