->\n\n<!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#555\"},\"typography\":{\"fontSize\":\"1rem\",\"lineHeight\":\"1.75\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#555;font-size:1rem;line-height:1.75\">Escolha o dia e horário que funcionam pra você. O link da videochamada - setting online - é criado automaticamente. Você recebe confirmação imediata. Cancelar ou reagendar também é simples — sem burocracia, sem julgamento.</p>\n<!-- /wp:paragraph --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column --></div>\n<!-- /wp:columns -->\n\n<!-- wp:columns {\"align\":\"wide\",\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"blockGap\":{\"left\":\"64px\"},\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"64px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-columns alignwide\" style=\"margin-bottom:64px\"><!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:image {\"id\":98,\"sizeSlug\":\"full\",\"linkDestination\":\"none\",\"style\":{\"border\":{\"radius\":\"20px\"}}} -->\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full has-custom-border\"><img src=\"https://meudivaonline.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/37.png\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-98\" style=\"border-radius:20px\"/></figure>\n<!-- /wp:image --></div>\n<!-- /wp:column -->\n\n<!-- wp:column {\"verticalAlignment\":\"center\",\"width\":\"50%\"} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-column is-vertically-aligned-center\" style=\"flex-basis:50%\"><!-- wp:group {\"style\":{\"spacing\":{\"margin\":{\"bottom\":\"20px\"}}}} -->\n<div class=\"wp-block-group\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px\"><!-- wp:paragraph {\"style\":{\"color\":{\"text\":\"#ffffff\"},\"typography\":{\"fontWeight\":\"800\",\"fontSize\":\"1rem\"}}} -->\n<p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"color:#ffffff;font-size:1rem;font-weight:800\"><p class=\"has-text-color\" style=\"background:#E03673;color:#ffffff;font-weight:800;font-size:1rem;width:36px;height:36px;border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0;flex-shrink: